{
  "$Comment": "Mob Battle training flail fighter's combat with the player's own rusty steel flail attacks (the game's only flail; older weapon set: no signature energy). Basic = Club_Flail_Attack (swing left, swing right). Charged = the same Club_Flail_Attack held: ChargeFor 1.39 = its only charge key (Club_Flail_Spin_Swing_Left_Charged). Guard = Club_Block (the flail item binds none; its Club_Flail animation set has the Guard animation Club_Block plays) after taking damage. Every action carries Weapon_Club_Steel_Flail_Rusty's interaction vars, plus Club_Block_Damage with the game's own default. Kept distances: the role's MaintainDistance takes its range from each action's PostExecuteDistanceRange, so they all stay inside the basic attack's reach (strafe 2.5-4 kept it out of reach, staring at its rival); basic attack Timeout 0.5 lets it finish aiming instead of losing the try and waiting a cooldown.",
